{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple and casual 2D platformer game with cute, brightly colored pixel graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the bubble guy travel through various worlds, including steep mountains, clear lakes, scorching deserts, dilapidated factories, flourishing farms, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap over obstacles, stomp on enemies, avoid the hostile creatures and water sources that are dangerous to the bubble guy, and reach the final destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 14 levels in total. As you progress, you can unlock new skills and new skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, it\u2019s not difficult to complete the game, but some levels require a bit of skill. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614140?t=1763128501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614140/8cd36413e4e4f87ecb83d0434bf692f002656e8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763128501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614140/82374fdf4fc521318b96423e1b5679088ee72e9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763128501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614140/82374fdf4fc521318b96423e1b5679088ee72e9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763128501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple and casual 2D platformer game with cute, brightly colored pixel graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the bubble guy travel through various worlds, including steep mountains, clear lakes, scorching deserts, dilapidated factories, flourishing farms, and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap over obstacles, stomp on enemies, avoid the hostile creatures and water sources that are dangerous to the bubble guy, and reach the final destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 14 levels in total. As you progress, you can unlock new skills and new skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, it\u2019s not difficult to complete the game, but some levels require a bit of skill. </p>","developers":["Grove"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614140/d46fef8a47ff97564273929cab60b3b91e618334/header.jpg?t=1763128501","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3614140/1312275459/ac9ab97a3dfb8cff2e02f6fd1a346e449301d665/1763124332/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763128500","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3614140/1312275459/ac9ab97a3dfb8cff2e02f6fd1a346e449301d665/1763124332/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763128500","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3614140/1312275459/ac9ab97a3dfb8cff2e02f6fd1a346e449301d665/1763124332/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763128500","id":257117733,"name":"Bubble's Adventure","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117733/edd21fc0b5b999fcee14dd86f029d7d17b003cce/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763128500"}],"name":"Bubble's Adventure \u6ce1\u6ce1\u4eba\u5927\u5192\u9669","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurr